* Three-level hierarchy: open a calendar, select a time, and send an invitation.
Goal: Schedule a meeting
. Goal: Open calendar application
.. Look at <calendar application>
.. Point to <calendar application>
.. Click <calendar application>
.. Verify calendar is open
. Goal: Create meeting
.. Goal: Select time slot
... Search for <available time>
... Look at <available time>
... Point to <available time>
... Click <available time>
.. Goal: Add meeting details
... Hands to keyboard
... Type <meeting title>
... Type <attendee name>
.. Goal: Send invitation
... Look at <send invitation button>
... Point to <send invitation button>
... Click <send invitation button>
... Verify invitation is sent
